<title>KENYA: CRICKET-KENYA 188-9 V SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-KENYA 188-9 V SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenya were 188 for nine in their 50 overs in the opening game of the Kenyan centenary four-nation cricket tournament against Sri Lanka on Saturday.</p>
</text>
